P1 Phase Self-Calibration Report:
After applying the first phase self-calibration (16 min), the image quality improved. 
The peak intensity increased from 0.324 Jy/beam to 0.371 Jy/beam, while the residual RMS decreased from 0.182 mJy/beam to 0.145 mJy/beam. 
The maximum residual also decreased from 12.7 mJy to 6.45 mJy. The total flux changed only slightly (2.562 Jy → 2.617 Jy), indicating that the source flux was preserved. 
The cleaning stopped after reaching the 0.3 mJy threshold, showing that the first phase self-calibration was successful and improved the image quality.

